      "instance_name": "distress",
      "label": "distressed emotion",
      "description": "The man in traditional attire appears visibly distressed in the second panel, with a worried facial expression and body language, as he conveys his suicidal ideation. This emotional state is directly expressed through his facial expression and the accompanying text 'i'm feeling suicidal'.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
